Package: vabaxos-reader
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: text
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, espeak-ng, libpulse0, poppler-utils, python3-docx, python3-ebooklib
Suggests: vabaxos-voice
Description: Documents read aloud
 The VabaxOS reader opens text, PDF, Word, EPUB and HTML documents and
 reads them with eSpeak NG, or with the natural voice Kokoro when
 vabaxos-voice is installed, sentence by sentence, from the cursor. It moves
 by sentence and paragraph, changes speed,
 remembers where each document was left, keeps bookmarks and saves the
 reading as an audio file, for study and for long texts.
